  "description": "Modular Java implementation of the HL7 FHIR R4 and R4B standards, formerly the IBM FHIR Server, now maintained under the LinuxForHealth project. A mature, feature-complete server (search, validation, bulk data, terminology). Note: development has slowed markedly — the latest release predates 2023 and the repository shows little recent activity, so treat it as stable-but-dormant rather than actively evolving.",
